          <h3>Zanzibar Driving Permit</h3>
          <p>By Zanzibar law, tourists require a local Zanzibar Temporary Driving Permit ($10–$15, endorsed by the Zanzibar traffic police) in addition to their national license or IDP. Our rental partners process this permit in advance so you are 100% legal upon arrival. Driving is on the left.</p>
        </div>
